# Constant names exercise a projection the fields do not: C and C++ build preprocessor tokens by
# upper-casing the raw name, while the other four fold to UPPER_SNAKE_CASE first. `fooBar` and
# `FOO_BAR` therefore collide in four backends and not in the other two.
uint8 value
uint8 FOO_BAR = 1
uint8 fooBar = 2
uint8 break = 3
@sealed
